{
    "2": {
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's really there, in the recesses.",
                "You should see it for yourself."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose you won't believe in",
                "what I have to say, will you?"
            ]
        },
        "282_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A monster consumed by information!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're kidding me."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So just defeating that Ariya",
                "wasn't enough to resolve everythin'."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could that stone..."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Be the legendary Zoltite?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Zoltite? What's that?",
                "Are you talking about this Incident Stone?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you call it an Incident Stone."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Which means it definitely",
                "came from another world!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Patchouli speculated that this might have",
                "been created to save Gensokyo..."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But there's no way",
                "it's a stone from another world."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even if it shouldn't exist in Gensokyo..."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Zoltaxians have reason to control Gensokyo!"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Y-You're crazy!",
                "Just like that Yuiman!"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh..."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In other words, it's a stone",
                "that shouldn't exist in this world."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Here, all the truths hidden",
                "from the world wash up."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems you haven't awakened yet.",
                "How pitiful."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By learning them, I have awakened!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The intensity of these attacks really ",
                "make it feel like an <i$extra> incident started."
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Human of the old generation, listen well!",
                "This is the truth of this world! The <i$ultimate truth>!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How's that!",
                "I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "N-no way...",
                "But the truth should be unshakable..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "An unshakable truth, huh..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If something like that really existed,",
                "the world would be pretty boring."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I double-checked with Patchouli."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's true the Incident Stone",
                "resolved the incident."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But most of the information about it",
                "is nonsense, so don't be fooled."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can agree with that, now that I've faced",
                "a monster that spouts nothing but nonsense."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? N-nonsense?",
                "Th-that can't be the case..."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So have you checked?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whether it's true or not, with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Waaah... The thing is, I'm just a shellfish fossil",
                "that was only asleep here the whole time, you see..."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just recently revived,",
                "and the information flowing in was all I had."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I haven't verified anything for myself."
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, you poor thing.",
                "You newborn guy, or, rather, newborn youkai..."
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Getting tricked into believing fake truths",
                "and missing things right in front of you."
            ]
        }
    }
}